# ─── DynaX Frontend — PRODUCTION env (loaded by `next build` on Vercel) ───────
# These are safe to commit (all are public NEXT_PUBLIC_* values). You can also
# set them in the Vercel dashboard, where they override this file.

# Go backend on Render (MUST include /api/v1, no trailing slash)
